  question: "\u0110\xE8n t\xEDn hi\u1EC7u giao th\xF4ng d\xF9ng cho vi\u1EC7c g\xEC
    ?"
  level: "Trung b\xECnh"
  answer:
  - "\u0110i\u1EC1u ph\u1ED1i l\u01B0\u1EE3ng xe tr\xEAn \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng v\xE0
